#. module: ems
#: model:mail.template,body_html:ems.email_template_enrollment_send
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>Dear <strong t-out=\"object.partner_id.name\"/>,</p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            We are writing to inform you that the enrollment proposal for the upcoming academic year\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.ems_course_id.name\"/> is now available.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>To complete the enrollment, please follow these steps:</p>\n"
"                        <ol>\n"
"                            <li>Access the school portal: <a t-attf-href=\"{{ object.get_base_url() }}/ca/my/gestion-matriculas\">my enrollment</a></li>\n"
"                            <li>Respond to the required authorizations.</li>\n"
"                            <li>Review the enrollment fees.</li>\n"
"                            <li>Select the payment method.</li>\n"
"                            <li>Click the <strong>Final Confirmation</strong> button.</li>\n"
"                        </ol>\n"
"                        <p><em>Note: If you notice any issue or have any questions about the fees, you can send a comment to the Secretariat directly from the portal before confirming.</em></p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Kind regards,<br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\"><br/>📞 <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/></t>\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\"><br/>✉️ <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/></t>\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                \n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>Benvolgut/da <strong t-out=\"object.partner_id.name\"/>,</p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Ens posem en contacte amb vostè per informar que la proposta de matrícula per al curs vinent\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.ems_course_id.name\"/> ja està disponible.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>Per completar la matrícula, si us plau, segueixi els passos següents:</p>\n"
"                        <ol>\n"
"                            <li>Accedeixi al portal del centre: <a t-attf-href=\"{{ object.get_base_url() }}/ca/my/gestion-matriculas\">la meva matrícula</a></li>\n"
"                            <li>Respongui les autoritzacions requerides.</li>\n"
"                            <li>Revisi els conceptes econòmics de la matrícula.</li>\n"
"                            <li>Seleccioni la forma de pagament.</li>\n"
"                            <li>Premi el botó de <strong>Confirmació final</strong>.</li>\n"
"                        </ol>\n"
"                        <p><em>Nota: Si detecta alguna incidència o té algun dubte amb els conceptes, pot enviar un comentari a Secretaria des del mateix portal, abans de confirmar el tràmit.</em></p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Atentament,<br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\"><br/>📞 <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/></t>\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\"><br/>✉️ <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/></t>\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                \n"
"            "

#. module: ems
#: model:mail.template,body_html:ems.mail_attendance_issue_status
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Dear family,\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            This is an automated email, in order to inform you about an attendance status:\n"
"                            </p><ul>\n"
"                                <li><strong>Student:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_issue_student_id.student_id\"/></li>\n"
"                                <li><strong>Date:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.weekday\"/>, <t t-out=\"object.attendance_session_id.date\"/> from <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.start_time\" t-options=\"{'widget': 'float_time'}\"/> to <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.end_time\" t-options=\"{'widget': 'float_time'}\"/></li>                                \n"
"                                <li><strong>Session:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.attendance_schedule_id.attendance_template_id\"/></li>\n"
"                                <li><strong>Status:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_status\"/></li>\n"
"                                <t t-if=\"object.notes\">\n"
"                                    <li><strong>Details:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.notes\"/></li>\n"
"                                </t>\n"
"                            </ul>                        \n"
"                        \n"
"                        <p>If you need further information, you can contact with <t t-out=\"object.attendance_issue_student_id.attendance_issue_tutor_id.tutor_id.display_name\"/> just replaying to this email.</p>                                                \n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Kind regards,<br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.create_uid.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                \n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Estimada família,\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Aquest es un correu automàtic, per a informar-lo sobre una assistència:\n"
"                            </p><ul>\n"
"                                <li><strong>Estudiant:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_issue_student_id.student_id\"/></li>\n"
"                                <li><strong>Data:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.weekday\"/>, <t t-out=\"object.attendance_session_id.date\"/> de <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.start_time\" t-options=\"{'widget': 'float_time'}\"/> a <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.end_time\" t-options=\"{'widget': 'float_time'}\"/></li>                                \n"
"                                <li><strong>Sessió:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.attendance_schedule_id.attendance_template_id\"/></li>\n"
"                                <li><strong>Estat:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_status\"/></li>\n"
"                                <t t-if=\"object.notes\">\n"
"                                    <li><strong>Detalls:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.notes\"/></li>\n"
"                                </t>\n"
"                            </ul>                        \n"
"                        \n"
"                        <p>Si necessita més informació, pot contactar amb <t t-out=\"object.attendance_issue_student_id.attendance_issue_tutor_id.tutor_id.display_name\"/> contestant a aquest correu.</p>                                                \n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Salutacions cordials,<br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.create_uid.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                \n"
"            "

#. module: ems
#: model:mail.template,body_html:ems.mail_attendance_issue_rectification
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Dear family,\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            We're sorry, but you recently received an email containing mistakes about some attendance statuses.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Again, we apologize, this is the correct attendance status:\n"
"                            </p><ul>\n"
"                                <li><strong>Student:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_issue_student_id.student_id\"/></li>\n"
"                                <li><strong>Date:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.weekday\"/>, <t t-out=\"object.attendance_session_id.date\"/> from <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.start_time\" t-options=\"{'widget': 'float_time'}\"/> to <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.end_time\" t-options=\"{'widget': 'float_time'}\"/></li>                                \n"
"                                <li><strong>Session:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.attendance_schedule_id.attendance_template_id\"/></li>\n"
"                                <li><strong>Status:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_line_id\"/></li>\n"
"                                <t t-if=\"object.notes\">\n"
"                                    <li><strong>Details:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.notes\"/></li>\n"
"                                </t>\n"
"                            </ul>                        \n"
"                        \n"
"                        <p>If you need further information, you can contact with <t t-out=\"object.attendance_issue_student_id.attendance_issue_tutor_id.tutor_id.display_name\"/> just replaying to this email.</p>                                                \n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Kind regards,<br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.create_uid.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                \n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Estimada família,\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Els demanem disculpes, perquè recentment han rebut un correu electrònic que contenia dades incorrectes sobre l'estat d'una assistència.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            De nou, les nostres disculpes; aquesta és la informació correcta de l'assistència:\n"
"                            </p><ul>\n"
"                                <li><strong>Estudiant:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_issue_student_id.student_id\"/></li>\n"
"                                <li><strong>Data:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.weekday\"/>, <t t-out=\"object.attendance_session_id.date\"/> de <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.start_time\" t-options=\"{'widget': 'float_time'}\"/> a <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.end_time\" t-options=\"{'widget': 'float_time'}\"/></li>                                \n"
"                                <li><strong>Sessió:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.attendance_schedule_id.attendance_template_id\"/></li>\n"
"                                <li><strong>Estat:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_status\"/></li>\n"
"                                <t t-if=\"object.notes\">\n"
"                                    <li><strong>Detalls:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.notes\"/></li>\n"
"                                </t>\n"
"                            </ul>                        \n"
"                        \n"
"                        <p>Si necessita més informació, pot contactar amb <t t-out=\"object.attendance_issue_student_id.attendance_issue_tutor_id.tutor_id.display_name\"/> contestant a aquest correu.</p>                                                \n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Salutacions cordials,<br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.create_uid.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                \n"
"            "

#. module: ems
#: model:mail.template,body_html:ems.mail_attendance_issue_tutor
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Dear tutor,\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            This is your students daily report, in order to inform you about today's attendance statuses:\n"
"                            </p><ul>\n"
"                                <li>\n"
"                                    <strong>Date: </strong><span t-field=\"object.issue_date\"/>\n"
"                                    <ul>\n"
"                                        <t t-foreach=\"object.attendance_issue_student_ids\" t-as=\"student\">\n"
"                                            <li>\n"
"                                                <strong>Student: </strong><span t-field=\"student.student_id\"/>\n"
"                                                <ul>\n"
"                                                    <t t-foreach=\"student.attendance_issue_status_ids\" t-as=\"status\">\n"
"                                                        <li t-att-style=\"'text-decoration: line-through;' if status.rectified_by.id != False else ''\">\n"
"                                                            <span t-field=\"status.attendance_session_id.attendance_schedule_id.attendance_template_id\"/> | from <span t-field=\"status.attendance_session_id.start_time\" t-options=\"{'widget': 'float_time'}\"/> to <span t-field=\"status.attendance_session_id.end_time\" t-options=\"{'widget': 'float_time'}\"/> | <span t-field=\"status.attendance_status\"/>\n"
"                                                            <t t-if=\"status.notes\">\n"
"                                                                | <span t-field=\"status.notes\"/>\n"
"                                                            </t>\n"
"                                                        </li>                                                        \n"
"                                                    </t>\n"
"                                                </ul>\n"
"                                            </li>                                                                               \n"
"                                        </t>\n"
"                                    </ul>\n"
"                                </li>\n"
"                            </ul>\n"
"                                                \n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Kind regards,<br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.create_uid.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                \n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Estimat/da tutor/a,\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Aquest és l'informe diari dels seus alumnes, on podrà consultar l'estat de les assistències del dia d'avuí:\n"
"                            </p><ul>\n"
"                                <li>\n"
"                                    <strong>Data: </strong><span t-field=\"object.issue_date\"/>\n"
"                                    <ul>\n"
"                                        <t t-foreach=\"object.attendance_issue_student_ids\" t-as=\"student\">\n"
"                                            <li>\n"
"                                                <strong>Estudiant: </strong><span t-field=\"student.student_id\"/>\n"
"                                                <ul>\n"
"                                                    <t t-foreach=\"student.attendance_issue_status_ids\" t-as=\"status\">\n"
"                                                        <li t-att-style=\"'text-decoration: line-through;' if status.rectified_by.id != False else ''\"> \n"
"                                                            <span t-field=\"status.attendance_session_id.attendance_schedule_id.attendance_template_id\"/> | de <span t-field=\"status.attendance_session_id.start_time\" t-options=\"{'widget': 'float_time'}\"/> a <span t-field=\"status.attendance_session_id.end_time\" t-options=\"{'widget': 'float_time'}\"/> | <span t-field=\"status.attendance_status\"/>\n"
"                                                            <t t-if=\"status.notes\">\n"
"                                                                | <span t-field=\"status.notes\"/>\n"
"                                                            </t>\n"
"                                                        </li>                                                        \n"
"                                                    </t>\n"
"                                                </ul>\n"
"                                            </li>                                                                               \n"
"                                        </t>\n"
"                                    </ul>\n"
"                                </li>\n"
"                            </ul>\n"
"                                                \n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Salutacions cordials,<br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.create_uid.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                \n"
"            "

